      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        80.14361572265625,
        365.4731750488281,
        109.03961181640625
      ],
      "text": "6.\t M  TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 24.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        145.39939880371094,
        87.01241302490234,
        510.22161865234375,
        107.23960876464844
      ],
      "text": "anagement of in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 16.799999237060547,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        235.056396484375,
        107.74359130859375,
        286.15234375,
        136.63958740234375
      ],
      "text": "HIV",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 24.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03939819335938,
        114.61238861083984,
        234.67550659179688,
        134.83958435058594
      ],
      "text": "living with",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 16.799999237060547,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        149.02223205566406,
        130.37139892578125,
        165.87823486328125
      ],
      "text": "6.1\t C",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        130.5872039794922,
        153.02903747558594,
        235.6632537841797,
        164.82823181152344
      ],
      "text": "hapter objectives",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        173.57098388671875,
        457.386474609375,
        186.9224853515625
      ],
      "text": "This chapter outlines how to prevent and treat TB in children living with HIV.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        208.9340362548828,
        125.70940399169922,
        225.7900390625
      ],
      "text": "6.2\t I",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        125.92539978027344,
        212.9408416748047,
        200.44459533691406,
        224.7400360107422
      ],
      "text": "ntroduction",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        233.4827880859375,
        513.391357421875,
        246.83428955078125
      ],
      "text": "Children living with HIV infection have increased risk of TB exposure, infection,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        249.47930908203125,
        513.4719848632812,
        262.830810546875
      ],
      "text": "progression to disease, and TB-related morbidity and mortality. This risk is influenced by",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        265.475830078125,
        513.4144897460938,
        278.82733154296875
      ],
      "text": "the degree of immune suppression. All children living with HIV infection in a TB-endemic",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        281.47235107421875,
        513.46044921875,
        294.8238525390625
      ],
      "text": "setting should therefore be regularly screened for TB by clinical assessment at each visit",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        297.4688720703125,
        513.4490356445312,
        310.82037353515625
      ],
      "text": "to a health facility or contact with a health worker. Evaluation should aim to identify",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        313.46539306640625,
        513.4951171875,
        326.81689453125
      ],
      "text": "those patients who are likely to have TB disease, requiring anti-TB treatment, and those",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        329.4618835449219,
        513.4375610351562,
        342.8133850097656
      ],
      "text": "who should start IPT. Suspicion of TB disease in children with HIV is initially based on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        345.4583740234375,
        513.4835205078125,
        358.80987548828125
      ],
      "text": "the presence of clinical symptoms. Clinical evaluation may be followed up with further",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        361.4548645019531,
        513.4029541015625,
        374.8063659667969
      ],
      "text": "investigations as appropriate (e.g. chest radiography). As for any child with suspected",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        377.45135498046875,
        513.3683471679688,
        390.8028564453125
      ],
      "text": "TB, attempts should be made to confirm diagnosis (e.g. culture, Xpert MTB/RIF assay)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        393.37884521484375,
        194.3238983154297,
        406.7993469238281
      ],
      "text": "(1). whenever possible",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        417.954345703125,
        513.4834594726562,
        431.30584716796875
      ],
      "text": "Childhood HIV infection is particularly common in settings where antenatal HIV",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        433.9508361816406,
        513.3798217773438,
        447.3023376464844
      ],
      "text": "prevalence is high and PMTCT interventions are not widely implemented. The prevalence",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        449.94732666015625,
        513.4835815429688,
        463.298828125
      ],
      "text": "of HIV is therefore particularly high among infants and young children, an age-group",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        465.9438171386719,
        513.471923828125,
        479.2953186035156
      ],
      "text": "also at risk for TB. In regions endemic for TB/HIV, TB is common in children living with",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        481.8713073730469,
        365.8003845214844,
        495.29180908203125
      ],
      "text": "(1) HIV, and HIV infection is common in children with TB  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        506.44683837890625,
        513.4376220703125,
        519.79833984375
      ],
      "text": "It is recommended that HIV testing be routinely offered to all children with suspected or",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        522.3743286132812,
        378.3929748535156,
        535.7947998046875
      ],
      "text": "(1) diagnosed TB   – see also Recommendation 7, Chapter 3.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        555.5537109375,
        131.92539978027344,
        572.4097290039062
      ],
      "text": "6.3\t A",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        132.1414031982422,
        559.560546875,
        261.75457763671875,
        571.3597412109375
      ],
      "text": "pproach to diagnosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        580.1024780273438,
        513.4835815429688,
        593.4539794921875
      ],
      "text": "The approach to diagnosing TB in children living with HIV is essentially the same as for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        596.0989990234375,
        513.4375610351562,
        609.4505004882812
      ],
      "text": "diagnosis in HIV-negative children, as described in Chapter 3. This approach can be",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        612.0265502929688,
        414.36492919921875,
        625.447021484375
      ],
      "text": "(2) challenging in children living with HIV for the following reasons  :",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        636.6065063476562,
        513.39453125,
        649.9580078125
      ],
      "text": "Clinical features consistent with pulmonary TB are common in children living with",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        640.2783813476562,
        91.36740112304688,
        648.2783813476562
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        652.60302734375,
        513.4521484375,
        665.9545288085938
      ],
      "text": "HIV but may be due to other diseases and therefore lack specificity for a diagnosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        668.5995483398438,
        136.8385009765625,
        681.9510498046875
      ],
      "text": "of TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        690.6065063476562,
        513.4522094726562,
        703.9580078125
      ],
      "text": "Most children living with HIV are infected by mother-to-child transmission. The peak",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        694.2783813476562,
        91.36740112304688,
        702.2783813476562
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        706.60302734375,
        513.4291381835938,
        719.9545288085938
      ],
      "text": "age prevalence for HIV is therefore in infants and young children (<5 years), who",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        722.5994873046875,
        513.3946533203125,
        735.9509887695312
      ],
      "text": "also make up the age group in which it is most difficult to confirm the cause of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        738.5960083007812,
        320.0335388183594,
        751.947509765625
      ],
      "text": "acute or chronic lung disease, including TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        760.6065063476562,
        513.4291381835938,
        773.9580078125
      ],
      "text": "TST is less sensitive in children living with HIV than in HIV-negative children; induration",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        764.2783813476562,
        91.36740112304688,
        772.2783813476562
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        776.60302734375,
        404.6505126953125,
        789.9545288085938
      ],
      "text": "of >5 mm is considered positive if the child is living with HIV.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        558.6439208984375,
        805.8439331054688,
        580.8839111328125,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "55",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}